libeasymcp2221 (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release the incompatible 2.0 API.
  * Remove deprecated 1.x compatibility APIs.
  * Finalize explicit error-code, ownership and initialization contracts.
  * Align command retry behavior with MCP2221 hardware and EasyMCP2221 quirks.
  * Harden SRAM, flash, GPIO, I2C, USB and analog API behavior and tests.
  * Finalize installation, pkg-config, Debian packaging and ABI visibility.
  * Complete migration, API-reference and build documentation for 2.0.

 -- Tobias X. Vogel <tobias.vogel@linux.com>  Sat, 15 Aug 2026 16:49:00 +0200

